# Writing documentation

Read `docs/writing/README.md` before you write, change or review any documentation, and follow it. It is the single guide for every agent in this repo.

Check names with `node scripts/docs-claims.mjs check <doc.md>`. Find docs that your code change makes stale with `node scripts/docs-claims.mjs affected`.
